; Make `npm install <pkg>` write exact-version specs to package.json by
; default (instead of `^x.y.z`). Enforces the tooling half of the pinning
; doctrine in docs/COMMIT_STANDARDS.md §8 at install time, so a future
; `npm install some-pkg` cannot quietly reintroduce a caret range.
; `scripts/lint_pins.py` is the backstop if it ever does.
;
; `save-exact=true` is npm's documented switch for this intent (it pins to
; the exact resolved version) and is immune to any future change in how an
; empty `save-prefix` string is interpreted.
save-exact=true
